<section xml:id="sec-attribute-references">
<title>Attribute References</title>
<simpara>The product is Widget. Undefined: {undefined-attr}. Escaped: {product}.</simpara>
<simpara>Redefined product: Gadget.</simpara>
<simpara>Unset product: {product}.</simpara>
<simpara> Dynamic attribute is value.
1 2 3&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;current 3.
a b  c.</simpara>
<simpara>Character replacements: &#160;&#8203;&<>&#43;&#166;|^~{apostrophe}\`::;;C&#43;&#43;&#43;&#43;.</simpara>
<simpara>Attribute with formatting: <link xl:href="https://example.org/widget"><emphasis role="strong">bold link</emphasis></link>.</simpara>
</section>
<section xml:id="sec-conditionals">
<title>Conditionals</title>
<simpara>Feature X is enabled.</simpara>
<simpara>Feature Y is not enabled.</simpara>
<simpara>Either X or Y is set.</simpara>
<simpara>Version is greater than four.</simpara>
<simpara>Empty attributes are still defined.</simpara>
